License and attribution

No blanket reuse license has yet been declared for the authors' original
code, prose, or packaging. Please contact Diana Mocanu and George C. Țurcaș
before redistributing or adapting those parts. Citation is encouraged.
This preserves the licensing position of the earlier companion; it does
not grant an MIT license or relicense third-party material.

Copied LMFDB input data and derivatives of those data are provided under
Creative Commons Attribution–ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0):
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/
Source: The LMFDB Collaboration, https://www.lmfdb.org/.
The LMFDB access page and its linked Creative Commons license were checked
on 20 September 2026: https://www.lmfdb.org/api/options.
The input notes identify the selected records, dates, coordinate changes,
and derived formulas. Attribution and share-alike requirements apply to
redistribution of these data and their derivatives.

Magma and other cited software, papers, and upstream resources retain
their own terms. No claim of ownership over those resources is made.
